/* PHONE EXEC -- Asterisk in the Debian guest, from CMS (9.25)         */
/*   PHONE STATUS            uptime and version of Asterisk            */
/*   PHONE CHANNELS          the active channels                       */
/*   PHONE PEERS             the SIP peers                             */
/*   PHONE CALL ext [ctx]    ring extension ext (context ctx, default  */
/*                           DEFAULT) and play a greeting              */
/*   PHONE HANGUP channel    hang a channel up                         */
/* over LXCALL: the options of LXCALL (SERVER userid ...) work here.   */
PARSE ARG LINE
IF STRIP(LINE) = '' THEN LINE = 'STATUS'
'EXEC LXCALL PHONE' LINE
EXIT RC
